     "body": "<p>Added some documentation to <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers</a> </p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Added <tt>Overwrite-Tombstone</tt> under the PUT section</li>\n\t<li>Updated note about tombstones indicating they can also be overwritten</li>\n\t<li>Added <tt>405</tt> response to DELETE section, specifying that it is only for tombstones in archival groups</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "06/Jun/24 6:36 PM",
