     },
     "body": "<p>A few additional updates made per review:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Removed archival group only note about overwriting tombstones</li>\n\t<li>Added additional status responses to PUT when create/overwriting an archival group (201) or trying to change the interaction model (409)</li>\n\t<li>I also updated the page to try and make it easier to update in the future by creating an <tt>excerpt</tt> for each HTTP request rather than having them all be in one.</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "21/Jun/24 7:19 PM",
