  "description": "<p>We updated Tombstone behavior in Archival Groups in <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3883\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3883</a>, but never updated the documentation for this. The docs should be updated in order to show the new header as well as updating the expected HTTP response codes when issuing a PUT over a tombstone. </p>",
